  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/18/Rainbow_Balloon.png/revision/latest?cb=20250814190739\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Rainbow Balloon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rainbow Balloon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Rainbow Balloon</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 60</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>musicaln</span><span title=\"Musical note\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"musicaln\"><img alt=\"musicaln\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e6/Musical_Note.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20240626214914\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>35</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  10m</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 133</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Birthday Balloon Maker</span><span title=\"Birthday balloon maker\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/birthday-balloon-maker-36084\" title=\"Birthday Balloon Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Birthday Balloon Maker\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"51\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 5</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Rainbow Balloon</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">product</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 60. It's a special item used only for the Anniversary 2025 event.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making Guitar Balloon</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e8/Birthday_Balloon_Maker.png/revision/latest?cb=20260622102152\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Birthday Balloon Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Birthday Balloon Maker\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Birthday Balloon Maker</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Flower balloons are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/birthday-balloon-maker-36084\" title=\"Birthday Balloon Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Birthday Balloon Maker</a>.\n</p><p>To make a rainbow balloon in 2025, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/tomato-soup-8446\" title=\"Tomato Soup\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tomato Soup\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/garlic-33001\" title=\"Garlic\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Garlic\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"79\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/pineapple-30748\" title=\"Pineapple\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pineapple\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x5</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 10 minutes to make a balloon. Each balloon gives players 133 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 1 balloon per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat. Each balloon used on a boat will be rewarded with 35 <a href=\"/wiki/musical-note-36133\" title=\"Musical Note\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Musical Notes</a>, 39 musical note in a 1-star and mastered maker, 49 musical note in a 2-star and 70 musical note in a 3-star.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-birthday-balloon-maker-products-36108\" title=\"Category:Birthday Balloon Maker Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Birthday Balloon Maker Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/checkered-balloon-36115\" title=\"Checkered Balloon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Checkered Balloon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/flower-balloon-36433\" title=\"Flower Balloon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Flower Balloon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/guitar-balloon-36106\" title=\"Guitar Balloon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Guitar Balloon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/musical-balloon-36111\" title=\"Musical Balloon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Musical Balloon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/peace-balloon-36432\" title=\"Peace Balloon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Peace Balloon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/rainbow-balloon-36434\" title=\"Rainbow Balloon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rainbow Balloon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/record-balloon-36113\" title=\"Record Balloon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Record Balloon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/sunflower-balloon-36431\" title=\"Sunflower Balloon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sunflower Balloon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901031021\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.096 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1015/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5488/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 990/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 766215/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   63.459      1 -total\n 71.72%   45.510      1 Template:Infobox\n 33.12%   21.017      6 Template:Infoicon\n 20.75%   13.168      1 Template:Navigation\n 11.54%    7.325      1 Template:BirthdayBalloonMakerMenu\n  2.56%    1.624      1 Template:Languages\n  2.31%    1.469      3 Template:Clr\n  2.09%    1.329      1 Template:PageDisplay\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:36434-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901031021 and revision id 110598. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
